/addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUMURA, YASUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A process for producing a 2-ethyl-1,4,5,8-dimethano-1,2,3,4,4a,5,8,8a-octahydronaphthalene composition in which the total content of two specific cyclopentadiene trimers is 100 to 5,000 ppm, which comprises reacting cyclopentadiene and/or dicyclopentadiene with 5-ethyl-2-norbornene under specific conditions. By using the composition as a feed material for various polymerizations, homogeneous and transparent polymers containing no gel can be obtained.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de production d'une composition de 2-éthyl-1,4,5,8-diméthano-1,2,3,4,4a,5,8,8a-octahydronaphtalène dans laquelle la teneur totale de deux trimères de cyclopentadiène spécifiques s'établit entre 100 et 5000 ppm, consistant à faire réagir le cyclopentadiène et/ou dicyclopentadiène avec du 5-éthyl-2-norbornène dans des conditions spécifiques. L'utilisation de la composition comme matériau d'alimentation pour diverses polymérisation permet d'obtenir des polymères homogènes et transparents ne contenant pas de gel.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>